8974686_1032424907825732_3935096735865419117_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-g2SKwgb3MQ7kNvwGrszzd&_nc_oc=AdmfH1MqmRO6WsW-6baxi2NNa2DAePXBy4TRwpamK3TvjMOfl6WyZoaCcPm-_gB7Olo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftqm9llPC6r4gN59ZlEkvu8GM5ljylzZ8TQsYGzJFNfbQ&oe=69A59E2C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1659326611266834", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035357_1659326614600167_5868832121069241264_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oAu74t1DgRIQ7kNvwE8PCS8&_nc_oc=AdkWTietfA3ye7gLWWHTaP8BjvaGOPr9EIGAa4pjikCotOkGY6tMpUfoIz2Y2aswylM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft1c96o9w1W1FyJ6CNGZNspn25zD8v7Jp5gd4UxMVq_Bw&oe=69A5948B"}, "display_name": "Dementia Reality", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dementia Reality\u2122 is an innovative experiential caregiver training program using virtual reality technology to build empathy and understanding through an immersive caregiving experience. Dementia Reality utilizes both a caregiver\u2019s and first-person perspective of a person living with dementia to develop the skills and knowledge necessary to provide excellent person-centered care and improve outcomes. Each role specific training module is 1 hour long and includes worksheets and handouts to support the curriculum outside the classroom. Module-specific skills and learning objectives.", "short_description": "Dementia Reality is the first dementia instruction program combining skills training and real-life obstacles in a virtual environment. The outcome is more empathetic caregivers and happier, engaged residents, clients, patients, and family members. Dementia Reality\u2122 is a collaboration between CJE SeniorLife and Elderwerks Educational Services."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dementiareality.org/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dementia Real